    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i guess, but the \"rest\" i want isn't just like... taking a nap or a vacation. i'm talking about the kind of rest where you don't have to wake up and face the same feeling every single morning. like, what if the \"performance\" just isn't worth the effort anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
